  "description": "Cross-model deliberation plugin — Claude proposes an implementation plan, Codex CLI cross-examines it, they debate (ACCEPT/REJECT/COMPROMISE), and the approved verdict gets\nexecuted. Features a 7-phase workflow, weak objection auto-filtering, dual-plan mode, strict critique mode, and session logging. Two AI models arguing so your code doesn't have\nto",
